te a favorite classic to fulfill your unique destiny. Journey through vast kingdoms, gather magical resources, and build the strongest Empire in Final Fantasy history! Fight fire with magic to defend friends and defeat foes alongside millions of players from around the world! Do you have the strength and strategy to control the Crystal and rule the Realm?", "themes": [{"id": 17, "name": "Fantasy"}, {"id": 18, "name": "Science fiction"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/final-fantasy-xv-a-new-empire", "videos": [{"id": 19517, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "YISXbvzohO8", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=YISXbvzohO8", "title": "Final Fantasy XV: A New Empire - Alexis Ren in \"Epic\"", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/YISXbvzohO8/maxresdefault.jpg"}], "collections": [{"id": 39, "name": "Final Fantasy"}]}